# This repo is the PUBLIC tracker for a PRIVATE project. It holds a README and
# issue forms: no site code, no dataset, ever.
#
# That separation is the only reason this repo can be public at all, and it is
# one careless `git add -A` away from being broken -- run in the wrong
# directory, or after copying a file across "just to look at it". So the site's
# own shapes are refused here by default rather than left to vigilance.
#
# If you ever genuinely need one of these paths, unignore it deliberately and
# ask why the tracker needs code before you do.

# Site source
/assets/
/layouts/
/content/
/scripts/
/static/
/data/
/schemas/
/bin/
/public/
/resources/
hugo.toml
package.json
package-lock.json

# Anything that looks like the site or the dataset
*.html
*.css
*.js
*.yaml
*.toml

# Local noise
node_modules/
.DS_Store
